{"audio":{"src":"https://pub-13abeb101e2945d2a7f60234f6faf52e.r2.dev/materials/a2-roleplay-about-cafe-drinks-and-ordering-write-like-you-are-talking-to-explain-clearly-c/audio/main-1e6a9e9e923b.mp3","durationSec":79.56,"cues":[{"start":0,"end":2.02,"text":"Cafes offer a wide range of drinks."},{"start":2.82,"end":4.92,"text":"Espresso is a small, strong coffee."},{"start":5.64,"end":9.9,"text":"A latte mixes espresso with steamed milk and has a mild, creamy taste."},{"start":10.74,"end":13.76,"text":"A cappuccino is similar but has a thick layer of foam on top."},{"start":14.4,"end":15.52,"text":"Not everyone wants coffee."},{"start":16.38,"end":18.9,"text":"Hot chocolate is sweet and popular in winter."},{"start":19.8,"end":22.76,"text":"Green tea is a light option with a gentle flavour."},{"start":22.76,"end":24.64,"text":"Many cafes also sell iced drinks."},{"start":25.34,"end":28,"text":"An iced latte is a latte served over ice."},{"start":28.64,"end":31.74,"text":"Fruit teas, like peach or mango tea, are sweet and cold."},{"start":32.3,"end":36.04,"text":"Most cafes let you choose the size: small, medium, or large."},{"start":36.82,"end":39.14,"text":"Ordering at a cafe usually follows a simple pattern."},{"start":39.7,"end":41.24,"text":"First, the barista greets you."},{"start":41.7,"end":42.56,"text":"You say what you want."},{"start":43.1,"end":46.1,"text":"The barista may ask about size, milk type, or extras."},{"start":46.84,"end":53.88,"text":"For example, at Starbucks you choose a size first: tall (small), grande (medium), or venti (large)."},{"start":54.54,"end":58.36,"text":"At a local cafe, you can just say small, medium, or large."},{"start":58.88,"end":61.28,"text":"After you order, the barista tells you the price."},{"start":61.9,"end":66.92,"text":"You pay, then wait for your name to be called or for the barista to bring your drink to the counter."},{"start":68.2,"end":70.94,"text":"Most cafes are happy to make small changes to your drink."},{"start":71.62,"end":76.2,"text":"For example, you can swap regular milk for oat milk, or ask for no sugar."},{"start":77.16,"end":79.12,"text":"Keep any request short and clear."}],"words":[{"text":"Cafes","start":0,"end":0.38},{"text":"offer","start":0.38,"end":0.6},{"text":"a","start":0.6,"end":0.84},{"text":"wide","start":0.84,"end":1.12},{"text":"range","start":1.12,"end":1.46},{"text":"of","start":1.46,"end":1.68},{"text":"drinks","start":1.68,"end":2.02},{"text":"Espresso","start":2.82,"end":3.24},{"text":"is","start":3.24,"end":3.54},{"text":"a","start":3.54,"end":3.7},{"text":"small","start":3.7,"end":4.02},{"text":"strong","start":4.32,"end":4.44},{"text":"coffee","start":4.44,"end":4.92},{"text":"A","start":5.64,"end":5.72},{"text":"latte","start":5.72,"end":6.12},{"text":"mixes","start":6.12,"end":6.44},{"text":"espresso","start":6.44,"end":6.88},{"text":"with","start":6.88,"end":7.22},{"text":"steamed","start":7.22,"end":7.68},{"text":"milk","start":7.68,"end":7.98},{"text":"and","start":7.98,"end":8.4},{"text":"has","start":8.4,"end":8.54},{"text":"a","start":8.54,"end":8.7},{"text":"mild","start":8.7,"end":9.1},{"text":"creamy","start":9.16,"end":9.46},{"text":"taste","start":9.46,"end":9.9},{"text":"A","start":10.74,"end":10.8},{"text":"cappuccino","start":10.8,"end":11.26},{"text":"is","start":11.26,"end":11.46},{"text":"similar","start":11.46,"end":11.78},{"text":"but","start":11.9,"end":11.98},{"text":"has","start":11.98,"end":12.14},{"text":"a","start":12.14,"end":12.3},{"text":"thick","start":12.3,"end":12.54},{"text":"layer","start":12.54,"end":12.8},{"text":"of","start":12.8,"end":13.04},{"text":"foam","start":13.04,"end":13.26},{"text":"on","start":13.26,"end":13.48},{"text":"top","start":13.48,"end":13.76},{"text":"Not","start":14.4,"end":14.54},{"text":"everyone","start":14.54,"end":14.86},{"text":"wants","start":14.86,"end":15.14},{"text":"coffee","start":15.14,"end":15.52},{"text":"Hot","start":16.38,"end":16.54},{"text":"chocolate","start":1